                'They run directly on host server hardware without operating system overhead, maximizing resource efficiency and VM performance.',
                'They are easier to configure than Type 2 hypervisors.',
                'They disable VM snapshot functions for security.'
              ],
              correctOption: 2,
              explanation: 'Type 1 hypervisors eliminate host OS overhead, communicating directly with server hardware to maximize throughput for enterprise workloads.'
            },
            {
