                'To balance network traffic across public IP pools.',
                'To monitor container states on the node, ensuring they are running and healthy as defined by the control plane.',
                'To execute SQL database migrations.',
                'To schedule new pods onto empty nodes.'
              ],
              correctOption: 1,
              explanation: 'The kubelet is an agent daemon running on each node that ensures containers described in pod specifications are running and healthy.'
            },
            {
              id: 'q-kb-4',
